      "moduleId": "rn_7Tgb4gzybkSVcPDf::L2",
      "stem": "A formation-route calculation gives the reactants' total as -602 kJ and the products' total as -780 kJ. State the reaction's enthalpy change and its class.",
      "misconceptionClass": "subtraction application",
      "kind": "application",
      "modelAnswer": "The change is (-780) - (-602) = -178 kJ mol-1, negative and therefore exothermic.",
